        "thread_goal": "Design and iterate on the tax return preparation checklist and review steps.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 104021,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, as part of T2, I've created a first draft of the 'Tax Return Preparation and Review Checklist' (A2). Link: [link_to_A2_draft]. I've structured it into four main sections: Data Collection, Calculation, Internal Review, and Final Sign-off. Please review and add your comments and suggestions.",
