            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Thanks @104021. The structure is solid. I have a key suggestion for the 'Calculation' section: we should add specific cross-checks against prior year returns to spot major variances. Also, how are we planning to integrate the fraud red-flag checks? Should they be a separate section or embedded in the relevant steps?",
