            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Excellent points, @48446. I agree on the prior-year variance check. For the fraud red flags, my thinking was to embed them. For example, under 'Reviewing supporting documents', we could have a check like: 'Verify authenticity of large or unusual expense receipts'. What do you think?",
